1. Undo Feature in Text Editor

Initialize Stack undoStack

Function type(text):
    Push text to undoStack

Function undo():
    If undoStack is not empty:
        Pop and return last text
    Else:
        Return "Nothing to undo"

2. Call Center Queue Management

Initialize Queue normalQueue
Initialize Queue emergencyQueue

Function addCustomer(name, isEmergency):
    If isEmergency:
        Add name to emergencyQueue
    Else:
        Add name to normalQueue

Function serveCustomer():
    If emergencyQueue is not empty:
        Return emergencyQueue.dequeue()
    Else if normalQueue is not empty:
        Return normalQueue.dequeue()
    Else:
        Return "No customers"
